#!/bin/sh
# script/undefined-behavior-check: the host-logic tests again, under Miri's interpreter (milestone 79). Miri checks
# the rules no other gate here checks: aliasing (tree borrows), pointer provenance, uninitialized
# reads, and leaks. Kani proves the properties it is asked about, the fuzzers see crashes, clippy
# sees shapes; none of them sees a `&mut` that aliases. See notes/undefined-behavior.md.
#
# **"Miri-clean" means the sampled paths.** The interpreter is roughly a thousand times slower
# than native, so the exhaustive suites gate themselves down under `cfg(miri)`: ntp_proto strides
# its 10^9-value sweep, gpt skips its 460k-parse corruption sweeps. Each site says so next to the
# test, and the note carries the full exclusion list. The exhaustive claims stay native-only.
#
# Not in script/test or script/gates, on purpose: the sampled run is minutes where the host tests
# are milliseconds, and the class of bug it catches moves at the pace of `unsafe` blocks, not of
# commits. Cadence is the weekly miri workflow plus on demand, here. Extra args go to
# `cargo miri test`, so `script/undefined-behavior-check -p gpt` narrows the run.
#
# Name: ratified 2026-08-03 (Chris), replacing `miri`. Refused `miri` (it names the tool rather than
# the function) and `sanitize` (in a project whose thesis is confining hostile input, that reads as
# *input* sanitization, and the misreading is worse than the length it saves). The `-check` suffix
# is established here, in `shell-check` and `qemu-check`, and eight of twenty-six scripts were
# already hyphenated, so the long form costs nothing the directory was not already paying.

set -e
cd "$(dirname "$0")/.."

# The component rides the pinned toolchain (script/bootstrap adds it), but a machine bootstrapped
# before milestone 79 will not have it; adding it here too makes the script work everywhere the
# pin does, the same self-provisioning script/coverage and script/fuzz do for their tools.
if ! rustup component list --installed 2>/dev/null | grep -q '^miri'; then
    echo "==> Adding the miri component to the pinned toolchain"
    rustup component add miri
fi

cargo xtask undefined-behavior-check "$@"
